# iosfc_two_level: A surface of more than 4096 pages takes a two-level page table: root entries must be valid tables (else BadArgument), their tables must map (else NoMemory), and each table entry must be a valid page (else NoMemory) that maps (else NoMemory). A surface over 4096 x 4096 pages is NoMemory at once. v2 descriptors (a 64-bit allocSize); every page of the good surface is the same guest page.
